<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-066" chapter-id="c-jinshu-066-jin043-guoshu" source-id="s-jinshu-066-jin043-guoshu">
  <p id="c-jinshu-066-jin043-guoshu:head" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-066-jin043-guoshu:head:m0000" ref="5is_zik_jbp">劉弘</persName>，字<persName id="c-jinshu-066-jin043-guoshu:head:m0004" ref="5is_zik_jbp">和季</persName>，沛國相人也。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-066-jin043-guoshu:succession" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">及<persName id="c-jinshu-066-jin043-guoshu:succession:m0001" ref="5is_zik_jbp">弘</persName>卒，<persName id="c-jinshu-066-jin043-guoshu:succession:m0004" ref="5is_zik_jbp">弘</persName>司馬<persName id="c-jinshu-066-jin043-guoshu:succession:m0007" ref="92p_bwy_o71">郭勱</persName>欲推<persName id="c-jinshu-066-jin043-guoshu:succession:m0011" ref="e81_f09_000">穎</persName>為主，<persName id="c-jinshu-066-jin043-guoshu:succession:m0015" ref="5is_zik_jbp">弘</persName>子<persName id="c-jinshu-066-jin043-guoshu:succession:m0017" ref="5is_zik_jbp_A">璠</persName>追遵<persName id="c-jinshu-066-jin043-guoshu:succession:m0020" ref="5is_zik_jbp">弘</persName>志，於是墨絰率府兵計<persName id="c-jinshu-066-jin043-guoshu:succession:m0031" ref="92p_bwy_o71">勱</persName>，戰于濁水，斬之，襄沔肅清</p>
</text>
